@schoolId = 918a27f3-2321-4f69-a15c-9c61f9f4f818
@recordedBy = 4b6caa16-d2f1-49fe-bb91-490d4860d454

### Variable placeholder for created expense ID during testing
@expenseId = b713e8e0-d533-4d07-a2b9-15b7798fdf26

### 1. Create School Expense Record
POST {{expensesUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
  "title": "Electricity Bill - March",
  "category": "Utilities",
  "amount": 35400.00,
  "paymentMethod": "Bank",
  "referenceCode": "BK98765432",
  "recordedBy": "{{recordedBy}}",
  "expenseDate": "2026-03-31"
}

### 2. Get All School Expenses for School
GET {{expensesUrl}}/school/{{schoolId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 3. Get School Expenses Filtered by Category
GET {{expensesUrl}}/school/{{schoolId}}/category?category=Utilities
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 4. Get School Expenses Within a Date Range
GET {{expensesUrl}}/school/{{schoolId}}/date-range?startDate=2026-03-01&endDate=2026-03-31
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 5. Get School Expense Category Summary
GET {{expensesUrl}}/school/{{schoolId}}/summary?startDate=2026-03-01&endDate=2026-03-31
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 6. Get School Expense by ID
GET {{expensesUrl}}/{{expenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 7. Update School Expense Details
PUT {{expensesUrl}}/{{expenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Electricity Bill - March (Revised)",
  "amount": 36000.00
}

### 8. Delete School Expense Record
DELETE {{expensesUrl}}/{{expenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}